                ["Squad", "Long-lived, cross-functional team with its own mission", "Not set in the paper; Atlassian describes 6–12", "No formal leader; a product owner sets priorities", "Deliver and run one part of the product end to end", "Assigned, full-time", "Local optimisation"],
                ["Tribe", "Group of squads working in a related area", "Under about 100 in the paper; Atlassian describes 40–150", "Tribe lead", "Give related squads a shared home and coordinate them", "Assigned via the squad", "Hidden dependencies between squads"],
